Modification notice (July 2, 2026):

This copy of dungeonsplus has been modified by TechnoWolfTV for the
Adventurelands game. Change from upstream (init.lua, line 53):

  The mapgen dungeon detection previously read `mg_flags` from
  core.settings (minetest.conf only), which crashed when the setting was
  absent and silently disabled the mod when minetest.conf disagreed with
  the world's actual mapgen flags. It now uses
  core.get_mapgen_setting("mg_flags"), which reflects the active
  world/map_meta value, and correctly treats the "nodungeons" flag as
  dungeons being disabled.

